WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.784
The purpose of this program is to have the sprite draw

2
00:00:02.784 --> 00:00:05.516
the outline of a house, two walls and a pointed roof,

3
00:00:05.516 --> 00:00:08.352
one line at a time, and announce what it's doing at the

4
00:00:08.352 --> 00:00:09.280
start and the end.

5
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:12.784
The way my code works is: when the green flag is

6
00:00:12.784 --> 00:00:13.310
clicked,

7
00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:16.398
the reset block sets everything up. It moves the sprite

8
00:00:16.398 --> 00:00:19.126
to its starting spot at the bottom left, clears the old

9
00:00:19.126 --> 00:00:21.854
drawing, puts the pen down in yellow, points the sprite

10
00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.590
to the right, and waits one second.

11
00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:26.887
Then the sprite says, let's draw a house, for two

12
00:00:26.887 --> 00:00:27.370
seconds.

13
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.010
Next it turns left ninety degrees, so it's facing up,

14
00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.170
moves eighty steps to draw the left wall,

15
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.786
and waits one second, so you can see that line get

16
00:00:37.786 --> 00:00:38.180
drawn.

17
00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:41.170
Then it turns right forty-five degrees,

18
00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:44.741
and moves seventy steps, which draws the left side of

19
00:00:44.741 --> 00:00:47.770
the roof going up at an angle, and waits a second.

20
00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:51.250
It turns right ninety degrees, so now it's angled down,

21
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.656
and moves seventy steps for the right side of the roof,

22
00:00:54.656 --> 00:00:55.600
then waits again.

23
00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.194
It turns right forty-five more degrees, so it's pointing

24
00:00:59.194 --> 00:01:00.010
straight down,

25
00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:03.335
moves eighty steps to draw the right wall, and waits one

26
00:01:03.335 --> 00:01:03.970
more second.

27
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.781
Finally, it turns left ninety degrees, so it's facing

28
00:01:07.781 --> 00:01:08.700
forward again,

29
00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:11.350
and says yay, for two seconds.

30
00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.196
Every step happens in exactly this order, so if I

31
00:01:15.196 --> 00:01:17.971
swapped any of the turn blocks, the lines would go in

32
00:01:17.971 --> 00:01:20.851
different directions, and it wouldn't look like a house

33
00:01:20.851 --> 00:01:21.270
anymore.

